WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:03,930
Yoyo yoyo

2
00:00:03,930 --> 00:00:05,330
That man is so dangerous

3
00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:10,460
Your space transfer method

4
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:12,020
How many people can you take with you at one time?

5
00:00:15,050 --> 00:00:16,410
I'm afraid I'm going to disappoint you.

6
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:18,820
This can be constrained by distance

7
00:00:19,350 --> 00:00:20,590
with my current ability

8
00:00:20,990 --> 00:00:22,310
Only one person can be taken with you at a time

9
00:00:23,010 --> 00:00:24,090
And this distance

10
00:00:24,250 --> 00:00:26,130
can't get you out of the city safely

11
00:00:26,490 --> 00:00:30,860
Not now

12
00:00:31,180 --> 00:00:33,220
It doesn't mean you can't do it after you level up.

13
00:00:33,580 --> 00:00:35,340
After all, you level up so quickly, right?

14
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:39,680
How do you know I upgrade quickly?

15
00:00:40,420 --> 00:00:41,620
I never told you

16
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:44,780
You never said

17
00:00:44,980 --> 00:00:46,340
But I can figure it out

18
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:48,420
I'm just curious

19
00:00:49,060 --> 00:00:50,420
Why did you do it so quickly?

20
00:00:50,420 --> 00:00:51,580
How to use powers

21
00:00:54,420 --> 00:00:57,060
If you are diligent and studious, you can do it too
